        "title": "Fire Truck (video game)",
        "extract": "Fire Truck is a 1978 video game developed and published by Atari, Inc. for arcades. Fire Truck is built on the technology created for Atari's Super Bug game also developed by Allen.\nA single-player version was released as Smokey Joe. It is internally identical to Fire Truck. Both games were programmed by Wendi Allen. Fire Truck was distributed in Japan by Namco.\n\n",
